  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Avrop fr&#xe5;n ramavtal f&#xf6;r ISK revision av Trans Europ&#xe9; Halles</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Call-off from framework agreement for ISK audit of Trans Europ&#xe9; Halle</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta uppdrag syftar till att utv&#xe4;rdera Trans Europ&#xe9; Halles system f&#xf6;r intern kontroll och styrning. Konsulterna f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas identifiera eventuella svagheter. Resultatet kommer att anv&#xe4;ndas som underlag i en p&#xe5;g&#xe5;ende beredning av st&#xf6;d.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment aims to evaluate Trans Europ&#xe9; Halles internal control and governance system. The consultants are expected to identify any weaknesses. The results will be used as supporting material in an ongoing assessment.</narrative>
  </description>
